# 紹介の動画の場面「corridor」（tools/trailer.py が書いた手順。直すなら tools/trailer.py を直して flows を流し直す）
fps 60
start at x=-7.2 y=0 z=-1.2 yaw=270
mark in_a
hold forward 1.92
hold turnRight 1.125
hold lookDown 0.2
wait 1.0
hold lookUp 0.2
hold turnLeft 1.125
hold forward 1.6
hold turnLeft 1.125
hold lookDown 0.4
wait 0.6
hold lookUp 0.4
hold turnRight 1.125
wait 1.0
mark out_a
